        "context": "section",
        "id": "testcontext-context-customizers-registration",
        "level": 1,
        "roles": [],
        "title": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Registering "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "ContextCustomizerFactory"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " Implementations"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Registering "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "ContextCustomizerFactory"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " implementations by using "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "@ContextCustomizerFactories"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " is suitable for custom factories that are used in limited testing scenarios. However, it can become cumbersome if a custom factory needs to be used across an entire test suite. This issue is addressed through support for automatic discovery of default "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "ContextCustomizerFactory"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " implementations through the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "SpringFactoriesLoader"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " mechanism."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "For example, the modules that make up the testing support in Spring Framework and Spring Boot declare all core default "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "ContextCustomizerFactory"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " implementations under the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "org.springframework.test.context.ContextCustomizerFactory"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " key in their "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "META-INF/spring.factories"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " properties files. The "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "spring.factories"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " file for the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "spring-test"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " module can be viewed "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "here"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "link",
                "target": "https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-framework/tree/main/spring-test/src/main/resources/META-INF/spring.factories"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ". Third-party frameworks and developers can contribute their own "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "ContextCustomizerFactory"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " implementations to the list of default factories in the same manner through their own "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "spring.factories"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " files."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
        "id": "testcontext-context-customizers-automatic-discovery",
        "level": 1,
        "roles": [],
        "title": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Automatic Discovery of Default "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "ContextCustomizerFactory"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " Implementations"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "If a custom "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "ContextCustomizerFactory"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " is registered via "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "@ContextCustomizerFactories"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ", it will be "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "merged"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "emphasis",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " with the default factories that have been registered using the aforementioned "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "automatic discovery mechanism"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "testing/testcontext-framework/ctx-management/context-customizers.html#testcontext-context-customizers-automatic-discovery"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "The merging algorithm ensures that duplicates are removed from the list and that locally declared factories are appended to the list of default factories when merged."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "context": "paragraph",
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "To replace the default factories for a test class, its subclasses, and its nested classes, you can set the "
                  },
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "mergeMode"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " attribute of "
                  },
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "@ContextCustomizerFactories"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " to "
                  },
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "MergeMode.REPLACE_DEFAULTS"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "."
                  }
                ],
                "roles": [],
                "title": null
              }
            ],
